Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,A unos sesenta y tres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,años luz de aquí hay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:03.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,un planeta azul, como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,la Tierra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:05.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pero no te lo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,recomiendo para las
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:07.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,vacaciones: su
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,atmósfera supera los
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,mil grados.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Y según la NASA,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,probablemente allí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,llueve cristal… de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,lado, con vientos de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:13.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,unos siete mil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,kilómetros por hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tienes once
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,curiosidades más en la
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:18.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,dosis completa de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:18.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shock Mental.
